x323828.SamplingParameters:0","e:Lax323828Proofs.clique_approximation_implies_np_eq_zpp:assumption:Lax323828.TestRepetition:0","e:Lax323828Proofs.clique_approximation_implies_np_eq_zpp:assumption:Lax323828.TestSampling:0","e:Lax323828Proofs.clique_approximation_implies_np_eq_zpp:conclusion:Lax323828.CliqueHardness.approximation_implies_np_eq_zpp:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"The uniform PCP and clique reduction give a polynomial-time fair-tape test\nfor every registered NP language. Rejection tapes certify its complement,\nso complementary tests combine into a zero-error finite-tape algorithm.\nThe probability-preserving compiler implements it in the registered\nprobabilistic machine model with a worst-case polynomial clock. The reverse\ninclusion is the proved registered containment ZPP ⊆ NP.","nodeId":"p:Lax323828Proofs.clique_approximation_implies_np_eq_zpp","semanticId":"Lax323828Proofs.clique_approximation_implies_np_eq_zpp","tooltipHtml":"The uniform PCP and clique reduction give a polynomial-time fair-tape test\nfor every registered NP language. Rejection tapes certify its complement,\nso complementary tests combine into a zero-error finite-tape algorithm.\nThe probability-preserving compiler implements it in the registered\nprobabilistic machine model with a worst-case polynomial clock. The reverse\ninclusion is the proved registered containment ZPP ⊆ NP."},"p:Lax323828Proofs.clique_not_approximable_of_np_ne_zpp":{"href":"../lax-323828/Lax323828Proofs.clique_not_approximable_of_np_ne_zpp.html","incident":["e:Lax323828Proofs.clique_not_approximable_of_np_ne_zpp:assumption:Lax323828.CliqueHardness.approximation_implies_np_eq_zpp:0","e:Lax323828Proofs.clique_not_approximable_of_np_ne_zpp:conclusion:Lax323828.CliqueHardness.not_approximable:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"Contraposition of the main clique-hardness implication. This proof retains\nthat implication as an explicit archive assumption.","nodeId":"p:Lax323828Proofs.clique_not_approximable_of_np_ne_zpp","semanticId":"Lax323828Proofs.clique_not_approximable_of_np_ne_zpp","tooltipHtml":"Contraposition of the main clique-hardness implication. This proof retains\nthat implication as an explicit archive assumption."}}},"status":"2 statements; 2 proofs","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"prepared-graph\" width=\"2326\" height=\"513\" viewBox=\"0 0 2326 513\" aria-label=\"Proof dependency graph\" data-layout-digest=\"7980122dddd80ddd0ac63a920450619e5c59858b0576a7b9da6c9fbb81510f9d\"><defs><marker id=\"graph-arrow-proof-network-7980122dddd80ddd-statements:Lax323828.CliqueHardness\" viewBox=\"0 -5 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"0\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" orient=\"auto\" overflow=\"visible\"><path d=\"M1,-4.25 L9,0 L1,4.25 Q3,0 1,-4.25 Z\"/></marker></defs><g data-graph-camera><path class=\"graph-edge-hit\" data-edge-hit=\"e:Lax323828Proofs.clique_approximation_implies_np_eq_zpp:assumption:Lax323828.Amplification:0\" d=\"M722.664,458.767 L722.664,448.767 Q722.664,446.767 724.542,446.078 L1143.173,292.487 Q1145.051,291.798 1145.051,289.798 L1145.051,279.798\"/><path class=\"graph-edge-hit\" data-edge-hit=\"e:Lax323828Proofs.clique_approximation_implies_np_eq_zpp:assumption:Lax323828.CenteredProjection:0\" d=\"M869.123,458.767 L869.123,448.767 Q869.123,446.767 870.89,445.829 L1159.284,292.736 Q1161.051,291.798 1161.051,289.798 L1161.051,279.798\"/><path class=\"graph-edge-hit\" data-edge-hit=\"e:Lax323828Proofs.clique_approximation_implies_np_eq_zpp:assumption:Lax323828.EncodedReduction:0\" d=\"M1029.418,458.767 L1029.418,448.767 Q1029.418,446.767 1030.798,445.319 L1175.671,293.246 Q1177.051,291.798 1177.051,289.798 L1177.051,279.798\"/><path class=\"graph-edge-hit\" data-edge-hit=\"e:Lax323828Proofs.clique_approximation_implies_np_eq_zpp:assumption:Lax323828.FAFComposition:0\" d=\"M241.608,458.767 L241.608,448.767 Q241.608,446.767 243.576,446.41 L1095.083,292.155 Q1097.051,291.798 1097.051,289.798 L1097.051,279.798\"/>